9	 * registrationDate year, zero-padded (e.g. {@code SMI-0007-M26}).
10	 *
11	 * <p>Runs after {@link AssignCustomerCode} (which sets the customer code) and after
12	 * {@link BuildOwner} (which defaults the registration date), so both inputs are present.
13	 */
